<title>UK: TABLE-Albert Fisher pretax rises 1.6 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Albert Fisher pretax rises 1.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to February 28, 1997.</p>
<p>(million stg unless stated)  Shr (pence)		  1.97 profit   vs 4.14 loss</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	   1.85	    vs 1.85</p>
<p> Pretax profit		19.1	    vs 18.8</p>
<p> Sales (cont ops)	   588.4	   vs 596.4</p>
<p> Sales (discontinued ops) 81.2	    VS 231.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British food company is Albert Fisher Group Plc.</p>
<p>The company said it expected to make further progress in the full year.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
